<title>CANADA: Enscor says won't proceed with sale.</title>
<headline>Enscor says won't proceed with sale.</headline>
<dateline>TORONTO 1996-10-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Enscor Inc said on Friday its wholly owned subsidiary, Equion Corp, decided not to proceed with the sale of its industrial cooling products business to Thermal Dynamics of La Jolla, California.</p>
<p>Enscor said after further evaluation of the proposed sale and its terms, managment elected to retain ownership of the business. It said the division had a strong management team and continued to operate profitably.</p>
<p>Equion's California-based industrial cooling products division supplies heat exchange products to industrial customers.</p>
<p>-- Reuters Toronto Bureau  (416) 941-8100</p>
</text>
